  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false,
    "description": "Called from Transaction Execution (post-execute) and Standing Order Scheduler (pre-execute) whenever /fraud/score flags a transaction. Places an immediate hold (unsupervised), generates a plain-language explanation naming both the anomaly check and any Pinecone-matched historical pattern (FR-5.6/FR-5.7), and requires the customer to confirm via BOTH the emailed link AND an independent phone OTP (FR-5.8) before auto-releasing. Any dispute, non-response, OTP failure, or missing phone number always escalates to human sign-off -- never auto-resolved either way."
  },
